# Root build context is shared by every service compose builds with `context: .`
# (digikey, digigraph, digiquant, digismith, digiclaw, digichat). Their
# Dockerfiles COPY the service source dirs, so exclude only what no image needs.
.git
.github
.worktrees
.claude
.playwright-mcp
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
dist
data
docs
projects
openspec
tests
scripts
# Dockerfile.digithings-stack-cloudflare (Cloudflare Containers, root context)
# needs this one file; re-include it without un-ignoring the rest of scripts/.
!scripts/merge_litellm_cheaperinference.py
# Zammad MCP server (scripts/zammad_mcp/Dockerfile.mcp) also builds from the
# root context; re-include just that package.
!scripts/zammad_mcp
agents
apps/digithings-web
apps/digiquant-web
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
